## Mandatory Section Order (DO NOT CHANGE)

Copy template → change **colors + content only**. Section order is fixed:

```
1. .header          — Logo + DEE DAVIS INC. + sector .tag + .h-creds (CAGE, UEI, DUNS, SAM, NPI, DOT, MC)
2. .title-bar       — h2: CAPABILITY STATEMENT — [SOLICITATION-SPECIFIC TITLE]
3. .body
   a. .edwosb-box   — EDWOSB callout + SERVICE MODEL one-liner (sector-specific)
   b. .sh + .comp-grid (4 boxes) — CORE COMPETENCIES — ★ on top 2–3 relevant boxes
   c. .sh + .cols (2 ul.svc)     — SERVICE CAPABILITIES
   d. .sh + ul.why               — DIFFERENTIATORS
   e. .sh + .pp-grid (3 .pp)     — PAST PERFORMANCE & RELEVANT EXPERIENCE
   f. .naics-strip               — NAICS pills (solicitation NAICS FIRST + highlighted)
   g. .cert-row                  — Cert badges (EDWOSB/WOSB gold, others standard)
4. .footer          — .f-left contact | .f-right CAGE/UEI + "Prepared for [Agency] — [Sol#]"
```

**NO `who-photo` block. NO alternate layouts. NO section reordering.**

## Template vs Content

**TEMPLATE** = layout, CSS architecture, section order, logo embed, fonts, spacing — **from DAF master only.**

**CONTENT** = words in each section — **tailored every time** to the solicitation.

## What You Do

```
STEP 1: cp FAP2026SS_Family_Advocacy_Capability_Statement.html → SEND_TO_BUYER/[Sol#]_[Type]_Capability_Statement.html
STEP 2: Change colors per cap-statement-colors.mdc (sector lane — NOT the old purple/teal table below)
STEP 3: Replace .tag line (sector + buyer type + EDWOSB)
STEP 4: Replace title-bar h2 + footer "Prepared for" line
STEP 5: Rewrite edwosb-box SERVICE MODEL + comp-grid (4) + svc bullets + why + pp-grid (3)
STEP 6: NAICS — solicitation code FIRST pill with highlight class
STEP 7: Verify PDF — footer visible, nothing cut off
```

